finding('F03','ZhaohuoSource,Zhaohuo','mode/boss.js4099-4105: if owner==victim, cancel; target filter accepts fire OR owner==source','event/native_damage.rs Zhaohuo predicates; kernel/damage_skill.rs ZhaohuoSource','Self-source damage should cancel in Begin1, but native source body changes nature to Fire and delays cancellation to Begin4. Target-arm filter also omits owner==source when nature is changed back.','Self-source normal damage plus First Begin2/3/4 observers; cancellation must precede those. Mutate/restore actual admitted role and nature, no fake role names.')
